# MASTER PROMPT — HOTEL ARUNIKA SENJA ERP
## UI/UX DESIGN, BUSINESS WORKFLOWS, ROLE ACCESS, DATA, AND TESTING

Act as a Senior ERP Product Designer, Business Analyst, Full-Stack Developer, and QA Engineer.

Build and improve the existing **Hotel Arunika Senja ERP Hospitality Web Application** based on the provided assignment document, “ERP Hospitality — Skenario,” and its reference wireframes.

This is a university Information Systems project referencing the Odoo Web Version 17.0 interface. Create an original implementation inspired by Odoo's business workflow conventions. Do not copy Odoo source code or proprietary assets.

**The final application must be a working web application, not merely a static UI prototype.** It must support persistent data, connected business transactions, role-based access, auditable changes, reproducible tests, and public deployment.

If an existing project is available, inspect and update it instead of creating a separate project. Preserve working features and existing data where possible.

