## Business rules

1. Maximum discount is 10%.
2. A 15% discount must be rejected.
3. Confirmed order prices and discounts are locked.
4. Changes after confirmation require cancellation and a new document, with an audit trail.
5. Credit exposure must include outstanding AR, active uninvoiced Sales Orders, and the proposed new order.
6. Reject an order when exposure exceeds the customer's credit limit.
7. Confirmation must reserve eligible stock.
8. Partial deliveries must preserve outstanding quantities and create a backorder.
9. Invoice eligible delivered quantities only.

